					<p class="left-item-desc">
						Immersive VR experience developed in Unity exploring the history of psychiatric institutions in Piedmont through meticulous historical reconstruction.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="left-item">
					<h3 class="left-item-title">Nihil</h3>
					<div class="left-item-subtitle">Metroidvania Prototype</div>
					<p class="left-item-desc">
						2D video game revolving around a key transformation mechanic allowing players to change shape and unlock new abilities.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Right Column -->
			<div class="right-column">
				<h1 class="header-name" style="white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; font-size: 2.4rem; letter-spacing: -1px;">FEDERICO COLOMBO</h1>
				<div class="header-title">Technical Artist | Unity Expert | Game Developer</div>
				
				<div class="contact-info">
					<div class="contact-item"><i class="contact-icon">📞</i> +39-3513078191</div>
					<div class="contact-item"><i class="contact-icon">✉️</i> colombofederico28@gmail.com</div>
					<div class="contact-item"><i class="contact-icon">🔗</i> linkedin.com/in/federico-colombo10</div>
					<div class="contact-item"><i class="contact-icon">📍</i> Torino, Italy</div>
				</div>

				<h2 class="right-section-title">Professional Profile</h2>
				<p class="profile-text">
					Game & XR Developer and Multimedia Arts enthusiast, actively pursuing a Master's Degree in Cinema and Media Engineering. My goal is to bridge the gap between artistic vision and technical implementation. I specialize in VR/XR development, Computer Graphics, and Gameplay Programming, utilizing a strong foundation in rendering pipelines and procedural generation to elevate the visual and technical quality of interactive productions.
				</p>

				<h2 class="right-section-title">Work Experience</h2>

				<div class="experience-item">
					<div class="experience-header">
						<h3 class="experience-title">XR Master Thesis - R&D Graphics Programmer</h3>
						<span class="experience-date">03/2026 - Present</span>
