						<li>Developing custom Shaders and Post-Processing effects to establish and enhance the game's unique visual identity.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				
				<div class="experience-item">
					<div class="experience-header">
						<h3 class="experience-title">Teaching Assistant (GUI)</h3>
						<span class="experience-date">10/2024 - 01/2025</span>
					</div>
					<div class="experience-company-location">
						<span class="experience-company">Politecnico di Torino</span>
						<span class="experience-location">Torino, Italy</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="experience-desc">
						<li>Provided technical support and mentoring to students during lectures and laboratory sessions for the Graphical User Interfaces course.</li>
						<li>Created high-quality instructional content to improve students' comprehension of UI/UX principles.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="experience-item">
					<div class="experience-header">
						<h3 class="experience-title">Video Artist</h3>
						<span class="experience-date">09/2023 - 06/2024</span>
					</div>
					<div class="experience-company-location">
						<span class="experience-company">RKH SRL</span>
						<span class="experience-location">Torino, Italy</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="experience-desc">
						<li>Operated professional cameras (RED, Blackmagic 4K/6K, Panasonic S1) and assisted the DOP with complex lighting setups.</li>
						<li>Handled editing and post-production workflows using DaVinci Resolve for music videos, podcasts, and corporate content.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

			</div>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>
